# The shared snapshot is replaced by any activation's capture, not only one that
# raises its coverage. A duplicate behind the GC floor captures, and the trimmed,
# acknowledged entries are in no snapshot.
MODULE: NoTrimPastAckedCaptureRegresses
TARGET: NoTrimPastAcked
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture may lower the shared snapshot's coverage
PERTURBS: Capture

--- FIND
    /\ a \in up
    /\ rp[a] > snapCov
    /\ snapCov' = rp[a]
--- REPLACE
    /\ a \in up
\* MUTATION: the coverage may regress.
    /\ snapCov' = rp[a]
--- END
